From: Konstantinos Pitas <cwstas2007@hotmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] harbor_agent: run on Harbor 0.25.0

Port of swiss-ai/nemo-gym d2002ed3 (branch swissai/harbor_agent_osb_v0.8.0). Harbor >=0.20
merged Local/RegistryDatasetConfig into DatasetConfig and flattened OrchestratorConfig onto
JobConfig, no longer sets BaseLLM._logger, has Terminus2 build its own LLM through _init_llm()
instead of taking an llm argument, and moved allow_internet to network_mode.
requirements.txt pins Harbor v0.25.0 and keeps our pin's nemo-gym[dev,sandbox] extras (the
original also asks for ray, which this pin's harbor_agent does not need).
---
